  "title": "News | Orgiast - In-House Event &amp; Creative Production",
  "content_html": "<div id=\"contentsArea\">\n\n<section id=\"outline\" class=\"narrow\">\n<p class=\"txtC\">Browse Orgiast's news releases. Please note that the information posted is current as of the time of release and may differ from the latest information.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"backnumber\" class=\"wide\">\n<h4 class=\"mb30\"><p>Back Issues</p></h4>\n<ul id=\"tiles\" class=\"tilesContents\">\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/expo-reuse.jpg?fit=400%2C225&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/7166\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2025-03-31</span></p>\n<h5>[Re:Booth (Re:ブース)] Introducing Eco-Friendly Neon Signs and Illuminated Logo Objects</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/セミナー_WEBマーケサムネイル-1.png?fit=400%2C220&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6873\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2024-03-12</span></p>\n<h5>Online Seminar [Putting an End to the Web Marketing Outsourcing vs. In-House Dilemma.]</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/大阪市新事業分野開拓事業者認定事業（ベンチャー調達制度）」に認定-320-x-210-px.png?fit=320%2C210&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6840\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2024-02-02</span></p>\n<h5>Reusable Exhibition Booth [Re:Booth] Certified under the Osaka City New Business Field Development Business Operator Certification Program (Venture Procurement System)</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/IMG_5945.jpg?fit=400%2C312&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6770\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2023-12-06</span></p>\n<h5>[Award] 11th SDGs Business Hope Award</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/S__66609181_0.jpg?fit=400%2C300&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6717\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2023-10-06</span></p>\n<h5>Report on First Exhibit at Decarbonization Management EXPO 2023 and Thanks for Visiting</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/1694302250365.jpg?fit=400%2C363&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6698\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2023-09-10</span></p>\n<h5>Exhibiting at the 3rd Decarbonization Management EXPO [Autumn]</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/1005-0114-1000-min.jpg?fit=400%2C267&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6575\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2023-02-28</span></p>\n<h5>Over 80% of companies hold an &quot;IPO Commemorative Party&quot; when listing. More than half feel an improvement in &quot;quality of work&quot; and an &quot;increase in communication between employees.&quot;</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/choshinki_iryo_marketing.jpeg?fit=400%2C267&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6485\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2022-11-17</span></p>\n<h5>Over Half of Healthcare Professionals Perceive Challenges in &quot;Generating New Business Leads&quot; [The Reality of Sales and Marketing in the Highly Challenging Medical Field]</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/righttsushin-kekkikai_10-min-1.jpg?fit=400%2C267&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6383\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2022-09-02</span></p>\n<h5>Approximately 90% of employees feel that general shareholders' meetings have become &quot;stale.&quot; &quot;Motivation&quot; and &quot;loyalty&quot; decline [Survey on challenges in conducting general shareholders' meetings].</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/1658562412595.jpg?fit=400%2C248&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6211\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2022-07-23</span></p>\n<h5>[Survey of Business Owners on Actual Use of Virtual Assistants] 81.9% of Business Owners Report Effectiveness from Using Assistants</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/DXimage.png?fit=400%2C246&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6188\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2022-07-22</span></p>\n<h5>Digital Technology Utilization and DX Promotion Status</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Re：ブース画像_0622_sumnail.jpg?fit=400%2C350&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6171\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2022-06-27</span></p>\n<h5>Reusable SDGs-Type Exhibition Booth: Re:Booth (Reブース)</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/booth_inner_3.png?fit=400%2C280&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6041\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2022-06-14</span></p>\n<h5>While over 70% of companies are implementing SDGs initiatives, the reality is that trade show booth installations remain &quot;single-use.&quot;</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/初任給ギフト.png?fit=400%2C209&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/6019\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2022-06-03</span></p>\n<h5>82.1% of employees who achieved their division's goals engaged in &quot;reflecting on their original intentions&quot; [When you hit a wall, look back at your original intentions!]</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/リブース_ロゴ-1.png?fit=400%2C220&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/5913\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2022-03-14</span></p>\n<h5>Launch of Eco-Friendly Non-Disposable Exhibition Booth &quot;Re:Booth&quot; (Re:ブース)</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/online.png?fit=354%2C240&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/4836\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2021-09-22</span></p>\n<h5>Announcement of New Online Event Service That Fosters a Sense of Unity</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/608880_l.jpg?fit=400%2C267&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/3734\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2020-12-23</span></p>\n<h5>Announcement of Service Launch: Live Funeral Streaming System &quot;Tsunagu Remote Funeral&quot; (つなぐリモート葬)</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/2020-11-24-8.png?fit=400%2C226&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/3640\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2020-11-24</span></p>\n<h5>Listing Ceremony Expert Planning Service</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/47caf3cb85422734c084f195fef3198f.jpg?fit=320%2C210&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/388\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2020-07-15</span></p>\n<h5>Introduction of the &quot;Rookie of the Year&quot; Award System</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/LT_19_b.png?fit=400%2C267&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/3267\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2020-06-03</span></p>\n<h5>We have started accepting applications for online internships.</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/image.png?fit=400%2C367&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/3271\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2020-05-22</span></p>\n<h5>We have launched &quot;Telework Implementation Support&quot;!</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i1.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/キャプチャ.jpg?fit=400%2C224&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/3062\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2020-03-11</span></p>\n<h5>Notice of Launch of &quot;Online Internal Event Production Service&quot;</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/logo1.png?fit=400%2C261&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/268\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2014-03-14</span></p>\n<h5>Launched specialized e-commerce site for in-house events 'In-House Event Department Store'</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n \n<li class=\"newsrelease\" style=\"background-image:url(https://i2.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/8c8e8aa78fee95f18e8f81u82a082f182b582f1838983c83t81v82s8c8e8d86.png?fit=400%2C274&ssl=1);\">\n<a href=\"https://www.orgiast.jp/newsrelease/220\">\n<div>\n<p><span>2013-02-27</span></p>\n<h5>Media Coverage: &quot;Monthly Information Magazine Anshin Life&quot; (Anshin Life)</h5>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n\n</div>",
